# the step keys' lights: a strong hit bright, a soft one dim, the quarters' empty steps faint
# (white 1 5 9 13; triplets 1 4 7 10); a quarter with a hit shows the hit. Empty start (CLEAR ALL)
wait 200
press GLO
tap HOME
tap HOME
release GLO
wait 20
expect track 0
expect hits 0
leds
expect faintkeys 2113665
expect litkeys 0
# a strong hit on 2, a soft one on 3, a strong one on the quarter 5 (w0 is key 1)
tapkey w1
tapkey w2
tapkey w2
tapkey w4
wait 20
expect vel1 100
expect vel2 50
expect vel4 100
leds
expect litkeys 132
expect faintkeys 2113537
expect dimkeys 1221680
# triplets: the quarters move to 1 4 7 10 (keys 13-16 dark); the hit on 5 moved to 4, a quarter
tap HOME
spin K1 1
wait 20
expect tpar23 1
tap HOME
leds
expect faintkeys 67585
shot quarter-lights.png
